MORQ release notice

1. Public textbook stimuli

The 197 files named data/assets/images/org_*_redrawn.png were generated
independently from structured reaction records. The generator did not read or
reuse pixels from the historical textbook images. These public redraws are
included in the CC BY 4.0 grant in LICENSE.

2. Historical stimuli and results

Internal historical textbook images are not distributed and are not licensed
by this package. Prediction rows generated from those images are also excluded.
The released textbook results comprise 1,182 scored observations measured on
the public redraws for all six evaluated models. Fifty-five terminal failures
remain in the denominator as explicit zero-score observations: 52 empty Sonnet
responses, one Sonnet invalid answer-wrapper output, one Argon invalid output
without an <ANS> block, and one Argon provider timeout.

